### API de Carrito - AutoParts
### Base URL
@baseUrl = https://localhost:7053
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Obtener todos los items del carrito del usuario autenticado
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/carrito
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Obtener el total del carrito (cantidad de items y precio total)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/carrito/total
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Agregar un producto al carrito
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/carrito
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productoId": 1,
  "cantidad": 2
}

### 4. Actualizar la cantidad de un item del carrito
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/carrito/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cantidad": 5
}

### 5. Eliminar un item del carrito
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/carrito/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Vaciar el carrito completamente
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/carrito/clear
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
